{
 "id": "ANM-07",
 "name": "custom-visibility",
 "version": 1,
 "title": "Custom visibility animation",
 "summary": "A promo banner whose entrance and exit are drawn by two defineVisibilityAnimation functions: riseIn fades it in while it rises 60 % of its height, shrinkOut fades it while it scales down to 80 % about its centre; animationSpec names them as enterFunction and exitFunction.",
 "prompt": "A 'Show offer' button that reveals a promo banner which rises and fades into place; tapping the banner dismisses it by shrinking and fading it away.",
 "level": 3,
 "family": "ANM",
 "capabilities": {
  "primary": [
   "anim.custom_visibility"
  ],
  "secondary": [
   "anim.visibility",
   "anim.easing",
   "layout.state",
   "draw.transform",
   "input.tap",
   "a11y.labels"
  ]
 },
 "use_cases": [
  "card",
  "notification"
 ],
 "form_factor": "widget-4x2",
 "keywords": [
  "banner",
  "promo",
  "toast",
  "rise in",
  "shrink out",
  "custom transition",
  "drawComponentContent",
  "pop up"
 ],
 "teaches": [
  "Define a transition once with defineVisibilityAnimation {name, params [progress, w, h, x, y], commands}; it runs every frame of the transition with progress 0→1",
  "Draw the component yourself inside it: set paint alpha, translate or scale about (@x + @w / 2, @y + @h / 2), then drawComponentContent",
  "Attach the functions with animationSpec enterFunction / exitFunction (enterAnimation and exitAnimation default to CUSTOM) and set the easing with visibilityEasing"
 ],
 "pitfalls": [
  "defineVisibilityAnimation goes at the root, before the components that use it (a first-pass definition, like variable)",
  "Exit progress also runs 0→1: write the exit as 1 - progress for alpha, not progress",
  "drawComponentContent composites the component in a layer with the current paint alpha, so a paint alpha fades the whole subtree at once"
 ],
 "snippets": [
  {
   "pointer": "/root/1",
   "shows": "anim.custom_visibility",
   "note": "riseIn: alpha = progress, translate dy = (1 - progress) * h * 0.6, drawComponentContent"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/2",
   "shows": "anim.custom_visibility",
   "note": "shrinkOut: alpha 1 - progress, scale 1 - 0.2·progress about the centre"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/3/column/children/1/column/modifiers/1",
   "shows": "anim.visibility",
   "note": "animationSpec {visibilityDuration: 500, visibilityEasing: DECELERATE, enterFunction: riseIn, exitFunction: shrinkOut}"
  }
 ],
 "inputs": {
  "variables": {},
  "clock": null,
  "touch": true
 },
 "check": {
  "describe": "A tap on Show offer at 0.1 s, captured 0.2 s later. The banner is partly faded and still below its final place, rising into it; fully in place and opaque by 0.6 s. Resized (narrow 240, wide 540) the banner fills the width and wraps its lines on the narrow host; the rise distance is 60 % of the banner's own height (@h), so it scales with it. Show offer is the library Button (outlined). Mono looks have no motion: the banner is already in place.",
